WEBVTT

00:08:58.167 --> 00:09:00.143
And by being open and honest,

00:09:00.167 --> 00:09:01.934
not only are we helping ourselves

00:09:01.958 --> 00:09:05.518
but also our organizations
to have these conversations.

00:09:05.542 --> 00:09:07.781
And those are the ones
that are needed the most.

00:09:07.805 --> 00:09:09.268
Call me Captain Obvious,

00:09:09.292 --> 00:09:12.000
but isn't that the kind of place
that you want work in?

00:09:13.125 --> 00:09:14.542
Thank you.